<section><div class="wrap">
  <div class="head reveal"><span class="pill">How it works</span><h2>One motion. <span class="g">No menus.</span></h2></div>
  <div class="grid3 reveal">
    <div class="card step"><i>01</i><h3>Summon</h3><p>Hold your hotkey, or right-click and hold. The wheel opens under your cursor, right where you're looking. A quick right-click still opens the app's own menu.</p></div>
    <div class="card step"><i>02</i><h3>Flick</h3><p>Move toward a segment and its tools fan out under your pointer. An overshooting flick still lands on the tool.</p></div>
    <div class="card step"><i>03</i><h3>Release</h3><p>Let go and it's done. Scroll while the wheel is open to switch layouts; Esc or the centre cancels.</p></div>
  </div>
</div></section>

